removeVariable\\(String name\\)#{1}":[129,142],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - result":[143,156],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - result#{1}":[145,156],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - scratchpad\\(\\)":[157,172],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - scratchpad\\(\\)#{1}":[159,172],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - setResult\\(String result\\)":[173,188],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - setResult\\(String result\\)#{1}":[175,188],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - setVariable\\(String name, Object value\\)":[189,205],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - setVariable\\(String name, Object value\\)#{1}":[191,205],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - warn\\(String message, Object args\\)":[206,223],"#Workflow- Scoped#Scoped Workflow - warn\\(String message, Object args\\)#{1}":[208,223]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":28}],"metadata":{"title":"Workflow - Scoped","description":"The scoped Workflow API provides methods that can be used in an activity definition script.Adds a debug message to the log.Adds an error message to the log.Returns the specified variable's value.Adds an informational message to the log.Object that contains the workflow variables.Returns the workflow name.Removes the specified variable from the workflow.Element of the workflow object that contains the workflow results.Returns the workflow's scratchpad object.Sets the workflow's result.Sets the specified variable to the specified value.Adds a warning message to the log.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/c\\_WorkflowScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","AP